  "extract": "Philipp Mainländer was a German philosopher and poet. Born Philipp Batz, he later changed his name to \"Mainländer\" in homage to his hometown, Offenbach am Main. Mainländer is best known for his pessimistic cosmic philosophy, deeply influenced by Arthur Schopenhauer.",
